🗄️ Bank Credit & Debit Analysis — SQL
Overview
This module contains the SQL database design, data preparation, validation, and business analysis for the Bank Credit & Debit Analysis project.

SQL is used to transform transaction-level data into meaningful business insights.

Objectives
Create a banking transaction database.
Validate and clean transaction data.
Calculate banking KPIs.
Analyze customer behavior.
Analyze credit and debit transactions.
Analyze monthly trends.
Identify top customers and branches.
Generate business insights.
SQL Files
