├── data_cleaning.sql
└── analysis_queries.sql
Example Table
CREATE TABLE bank_transactions (
    transaction_id VARCHAR(50),
    customer_id VARCHAR(50),
    account_id VARCHAR(50),
    transaction_date DATE,
    transaction_type VARCHAR(20),
    transaction_category VARCHAR(100),
    amount DECIMAL(18,2),
    account_type VARCHAR(50),
    branch VARCHAR(100),
    city VARCHAR(100),
    payment_mode VARCHAR(50),
    balance_after_transaction DECIMAL(18,2)
);
Business Questions
What is the total transaction value?
What is the total credit amount?
What is the total debit amount?
What is the credit-to-debit ratio?
Which month has the highest transaction volume?
Which customers have the highest transaction value?
Which branches have the highest transaction activity?
What are the most common transaction categories?
What is the average credit transaction?
What is the average debit transaction?
Which account types have the highest activity?
Which customers have unusually high transaction values?
