Main Analysis Areas
Transaction Analysis
Measure transaction count, transaction value, average amount, and transaction distribution.

Credit Analysis
Calculate credit amount, credit count, monthly credit trends, and top credit customers.

Debit Analysis
Calculate debit amount, debit count, monthly debit trends, and top debit customers.

Customer Analysis
Rank customers based on transaction count and total transaction value.

Branch Analysis
Compare transaction activity and transaction value across branches.

